          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 32,
            "column": 70
          },
          "text": ", keep a small cohort until the target version has enough real signals to compare with stable. Observe helps identify a deteriorating launch or WebView metric before raising rollout exposure; it does not automatically change the rollout. Configure "
